Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.95,0:00:28.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得那是发生在\N第二次航海的时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:34.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一个人被留在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.19,0:00:37.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果迷失在岛上的山谷里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.36,0:00:38.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.26,0:00:41.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钻石耶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.63,0:00:46.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有红宝石蓝宝石绿宝石
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.73,0:00:48.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.04,0:00:50.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是走不出去的话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.97,0:00:54.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算有再多的金银财宝\N也没有用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.91,0:01:00.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我费尽力气\N试着从悬崖往上爬
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.65,0:01:02.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是都失败了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.65,0:01:07.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了寻找其他出口
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.19,0:01:09.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经走了好几天了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.76,0:01:13.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的肚子好饿都快走不动了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.56,0:01:15.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许我会死在这个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.73,0:01:18.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛巴达好可怜喔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.40,0:01:21.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想他会获救吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.20,0:01:24.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结局你不是都已经知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.94,0:01:27.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底要看几遍才肯罢休啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.77,0:01:30.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦\N你怎么可以这样说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.21,0:01:32.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要打扰我的兴致嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.68,0:01:38.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有肉耶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.22,0:01:40.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肉竟然从天上掉下来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.92,0:01:43.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感谢阿拉的恩赐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.17,0:01:57.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那只鸟好大喔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.77,0:02:00.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管看几次\N都是这么有震撼力
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.77,0:02:03.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.81,0:02:06.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连阿拉都弃我而去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.16,0:02:18.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.93,0:02:20.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黏着好多宝石喔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.29,0:02:22.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,红宝石钻石蓝宝石\N这下咱们发大财啰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.66,0:02:24.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下发财啰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.20,0:02:25.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.20,0:02:27.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们为了捡谷底的宝石\N才会把肉丢下来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.80,0:02:29.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后再让大鸟叼上去…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.84,0:02:33.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许用这个方法\N我就可以逃出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.01,0:02:37.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能察觉到这一点真是不简单
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.31,0:02:39.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说对不对…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.01,0:02:42.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.79,0:02:51.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动作要快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.86,0:02:54.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大鸟要来啰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.56,0:02:57.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.91,0:03:11.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了 他成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.69,0:03:22.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了\N辛巴达平安的回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.19,0:03:24.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.46,0:03:26.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们也回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.53,0:03:28.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们再看一次好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.46,0:03:29.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要太过份了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.76,0:03:31.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一次已经是第三次了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.00,0:03:34.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经没有耐心\N再跟你耗下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.84,0:03:36.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.50,0:03:39.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,捡一个回去\N送给静香当作礼物好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.44,0:03:40.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.34,0:03:42.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以带一个回去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.58,0:03:43.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 不行啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.71,0:03:46.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,童话世界里面\N的东西是不行拿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.45,0:03:47.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.51,0:03:49.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是开个玩笑嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.85,0:03:53.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么事是你做不出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.59,0:03:59.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的好好玩喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.09,0:04:00.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还想再看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.09,0:04:02.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.76,0:04:04.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.50,0:04:07.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来要看哪一本好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.63,0:04:10.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好累喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.10,0:04:12.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太不够意思了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.11,0:04:13.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.21,0:04:15.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦你起来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.48,0:04:17.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.28,0:05:33.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的\N没梦想的人最无趣了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.06,0:05:41.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去找静香好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.23,0:05:44.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信她一定会很高兴的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.74,0:05:49.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.50,0:05:51.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有什么好玩的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.71,0:05:54.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好玩的啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.57,0:05:55.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.14,0:05:57.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看我来揍你怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.51,0:05:59.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一定会很好玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.08,0:05:59.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.75,0:06:00.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才欠揍呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.65,0:06:03.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早知道会被你打我就不说了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.82,0:06:05.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好无聊喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.89,0:06:08.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.09,0:06:11.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有什么有趣的事情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.22,0:06:13.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.16,0:06:14.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么态度啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.90,0:06:17.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个大雄竟然敢那么嚣张
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.60,0:06:18.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的好险喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.03,0:06:21.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差一点点就被他逮到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.60,0:06:23.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.10,0:06:24.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄是你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.04,0:06:26.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要去哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.47,0:06:30.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要跟钢琴教室的朋友\N一起去露营呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.41,0:06:32.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可惜喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.41,0:06:34.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本来想约你去一个\N很好玩的地方喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.85,0:06:37.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行耶老师们都还在等我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.35,0:06:38.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要30分钟就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.69,0:06:40.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…只要15分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.35,0:06:42.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么短的时间能去哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.56,0:06:44.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好玩的大冒险
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.19,0:06:47.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且还是一个\N可以任你挑选的世界喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.13,0:06:48.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.43,0:06:53.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有这么好玩的地方\N你为什么不告诉我们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.20,0:06:54.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也太不够意思了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.87,0:06:56.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是这样的啦…我…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.07,0:07:01.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实 那只是…\N用来骗小孩的把戏啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.94,0:07:03.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很无聊而且也很乏味喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.01,0:07:04.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.88,0:07:08.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来你找我去玩\N骗小孩的把戏啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.32,0:07:09.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.28,0:07:12.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你先听我说…\N算了 老师还在等我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.82,0:07:14.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.96,0:07:16.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.96,0:07:18.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.89,0:07:20.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.89,0:07:22.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不在啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.96,0:07:25.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说要带我们\N去什么地方冒险啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.23,0:07:28.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了啦\N快点带我们去啊大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.24,0:07:30.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要穿上这个\N“进入画册的鞋子”
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.10,0:07:33.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说进入什么东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.81,0:07:36.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该不是要进什么\N画册的世界里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.91,0:07:38.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.61,0:07:41.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为我们几岁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.82,0:07:43.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还说什么大冒险呢\N笑死了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.35,0:07:45.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笑死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.49,0:07:47.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一旦进到画册里面
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.99,0:07:50.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能感觉到\N像是真的世界一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.42,0:07:54.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像是跟恶魔作战的场面\N真的好精彩喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.49,0:07:56.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们没有去过就只会笑我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.56,0:07:58.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们回家好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.50,0:08:01.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 大雄别生气嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:05.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要穿上那个鞋子\N那我们就可以进去了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.21,0:08:07.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们就试试看好了 小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.01,0:08:09.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然决定要去的话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.38,0:08:12.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先从这里面\N选一本你们喜欢的画册
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.78,0:08:14.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些画册都好旧喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.15,0:08:16.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些都是我小时候买的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.28,0:08:17.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.78,0:08:19.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿起来就散掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.45,0:08:21.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你小心一点好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.39,0:08:24.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这本好像很有意思耶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.29,0:08:26.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,“杰克与豌豆”
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.46,0:08:27.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道这个故事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.66,0:08:29.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面会出现一个大巨人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.43,0:08:29.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.86,0:08:31.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就决定这本
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.33,0:08:32.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是鞋子只有两双
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.93,0:08:34.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先带一个人进去好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.10,0:08:37.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.27,0:08:40.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连你都会用了\N我们一定没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.34,0:08:43.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等哆啦A梦回来\N你也进来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.11,0:08:45.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.88,0:08:48.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 你先进去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.45,0:08:49.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是你先请吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.38,0:08:50.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说你先就是你先
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.85,0:08:52.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.12,0:08:57.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.49,0:08:58.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先说清楚喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.73,0:08:59.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们只能看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.59,0:09:00.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以随便乱来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.99,0:09:02.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.04,0:09:13.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个就是画册里的世界啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.61,0:09:18.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么怪东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.48,0:09:19.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是豌豆树啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.38,0:09:21.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,豌豆树正不断的\N往天空生长耶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.98,0:09:22.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.92,0:09:23.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.68,0:09:27.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那接下来会发生什么事情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.53,0:09:34.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里就是巨人的城堡了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.79,0:09:38.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个巨人\N会比我胖虎还要大吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.30,0:09:40.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概有你的一百倍唷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.70,0:09:41.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.57,0:09:43.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来跟他一决胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.34,0:09:44.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巨人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.44,0:09:45.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 不要啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.91,0:09:48.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放弃好了你不是他的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.17,0:09:48.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.68,0:09:51.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连看都没有看过\N怎么会知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.94,0:10:22.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大的巨人喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.34,0:10:22.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.84,0:10:24.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很大吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.24,0:10:27.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟画册比起来\N还是真实的比较有震撼力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.61,0:10:29.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来是怎么样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.22,0:10:31.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰克在不知情的情况下\N会爬上这棵豌豆树
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.95,0:10:33.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰克会爬上来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.35,0:10:35.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们要赶快告诉他才行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.06,0:10:37.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个时候杰克他呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.62,0:10:40.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个人一点同情心都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.19,0:10:42.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是这不是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.13,0:10:51.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰克…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.41,0:10:53.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰克
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.21,0:10:54.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经听小夫说了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.71,0:10:56.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两个到底是什么人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.01,0:10:58.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你先不要管我们是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.91,0:11:02.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这棵豌豆树\N会一直长到云端上喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.22,0:11:05.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里有一个大巨人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.59,0:11:07.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然说到最后会有好的结局
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.79,0:11:10.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过有好几次你都会\N差点被那个巨人吃掉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.02,0:11:11.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.89,0:11:12.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你有危险的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.09,0:11:14.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会帮你跳页
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.39,0:11:17.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直接带你去\N完美大结局的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.53,0:11:18.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳页
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.67,0:11:21.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别管那么多跟我们走就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.60,0:11:23.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真伤脑筋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.04,0:11:26.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在画册里面干嘛多管闲事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.41,0:11:28.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.41,0:11:30.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.04,0:11:31.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.91,0:11:33.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是要去露营吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.65,0:11:35.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.52,0:11:39.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我记错日期了\N应该是明天才对啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.45,0:11:41.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 那你快点上来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.65,0:11:43.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就玩一下好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.66,0:11:47.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我自己也是常常搞错呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.66,0:11:49.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好丢脸喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.26,0:11:49.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.06,0:11:51.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.20,0:11:54.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两双鞋子\N都被他们拿去用了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.67,0:11:55.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.54,0:11:56.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许找得到喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.94,0:11:59.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得放在预备袋里…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.41,0:12:05.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.68,0:12:09.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先从这里面\N选一本你喜欢的画册
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.45,0:12:11.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从这里面选啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.42,0:12:14.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我比较喜欢可爱一点的…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.59,0:12:16.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就选小木偶这一本
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.49,0:12:18.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后要怎么做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.19,0:12:21.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 穿上鞋子…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.69,0:12:22.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿上鞋子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.66,0:12:24.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.93,0:12:27.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们要进去画册里面啰
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.33,0:12:28.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.87,0:12:30.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直接跳进去这样就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.60,0:12:31.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.34,0:12:33.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要走啰
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.37,0:12:35.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.98,0:12:40.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮的星空喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.71,0:12:43.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮诺丘一定是在\N这个城镇的某个地方喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.75,0:12:44.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.02,0:12:46.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以见到他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.75,0:12:48.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们先找找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.62,0:12:50.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.14,0:13:04.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那间屋子…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.51,0:13:12.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.85,0:13:15.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仙女下凡来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.85,0:13:19.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮诺丘\N快点张开你的眼睛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.25,0:13:22.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经可以自己动啰皮诺丘
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.53,0:13:27.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会动了…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.89,0:13:28.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.39,0:13:31.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用系绳子就能动耶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.16,0:13:33.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会动了…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.14,0:13:39.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你肯听话当个乖孩子\N你就可以变成人类
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.41,0:13:40.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.64,0:13:43.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在皮诺丘\N他要开始出发去冒险了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.94,0:13:46.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香 我们到下一页去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.08,0:13:47.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.55,0:13:51.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 爬快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.08,0:13:53.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好慢喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.29,0:13:58.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一页哪是什么\N完美的结局嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.26,0:14:01.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这怎么能怪我呢\N我以为可以跳页啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.53,0:14:03.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然跑出一个巨人来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.30,0:14:05.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快把我给吓死了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.16,0:14:06.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.17,0:14:10.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果把画册弄乱的话\N我想应该会很好玩喔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.80,0:14:12.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这倒是真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.91,0:14:13.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.81,0:14:18.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的好想看一看\N到底会变成什么样的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.95,0:14:19.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.78,0:14:22.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要尽量把不可怕的\N放到最上面喔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.08,0:14:24.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.22,0:14:26.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就把猴子大战螃蟹的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.59,0:14:28.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放到最上面好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.42,0:14:30.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.46,0:14:36.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,木偶奇遇记的故事\N现在要开始进入最高潮啰
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.46,0:14:38.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮诺丘 快划啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.36,0:14:40.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用力划啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.87,0:14:43.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.34,0:14:49.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮诺丘 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.84,0:14:51.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点划
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.61,0:14:55.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点划要不然会被吃掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.12,0:14:59.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油 你要加油…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.09,0:15:05.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你克服这个难关\N就可以变成人类了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.53,0:15:07.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.63,0:15:09.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有暴风雨吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.40,0:15:14.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,木偶奇遇记里\N有这样的场景吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.63,0:15:16.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.64,0:15:19.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.28,0:15:25.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮诺丘 我不会游泳啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.98,0:15:29.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.12,0:15:32.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老爷爷 快抓住我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.42,0:15:35.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪 人鱼公主\N怎么会跑到这里来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.39,0:15:37.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香 我们到下一页看看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.79,0:15:42.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人鱼公主救了老爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.43,0:15:45.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人鱼公主好像\N也不知道该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.30,0:15:46.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本来就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.53,0:15:50.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人鱼公主她应该是\N救了王子才对嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.57,0:15:54.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她没办法只好回去海里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.31,0:15:57.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也跟去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.89,0:16:10.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.73,0:16:16.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这…什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.80,0:16:23.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不就是龙宫城吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.04,0:16:33.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说过了 我不是猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.55,0:16:36.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的不是猴子啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.75,0:16:40.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.75,0:16:42.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然我要\N被当做猴子给抓起来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.09,0:16:44.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点都不好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.22,0:16:44.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.82,0:16:46.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不觉得耶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.23,0:16:48.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.46,0:16:50.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.96,0:16:53.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回去啰
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.10,0:16:58.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老婆婆
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.44,0:17:02.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个苹果\N您就拿给白雪公主吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.81,0:17:04.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是跟你说过了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.61,0:17:07.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里根本就没有这个人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.28,0:17:09.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是明明就有啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.42,0:17:12.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说有可是就是没有啊\N白雪公主怎么会跟糖果屋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.62,0:17:14.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,的故事混在一起呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.95,0:17:17.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请问你是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.16,0:17:18.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是一寸法师
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.19,0:17:19.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是什么人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.89,0:17:22.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是姆指公主
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.36,0:17:27.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妖怪出现了…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.17,0:17:28.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妖怪…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.90,0:17:30.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神灯妖怪出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.54,0:17:34.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看 你们才是妖怪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.88,0:17:40.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乱成这样还满好玩的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.75,0:17:43.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 我要回去了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.48,0:17:45.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香 等一下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.72,0:17:48.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还想在这里看一下耶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.26,0:17:50.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想看了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.42,0:17:53.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意境这么好的故事\N被破坏得乱七八糟
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.46,0:17:57.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撞到什么了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.60,0:18:00.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是不可能的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.94,0:18:11.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.48,0:18:12.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.58,0:18:13.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.98,0:18:15.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他又跑到什么地方去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.72,0:18:17.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鞋子丢得到处都是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.28,0:18:19.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.79,0:18:22.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你快给我出来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.19,0:18:24.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你听到没有
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.19,0:18:26.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点出来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.76,0:18:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.29,0:18:29.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.20,0:18:31.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人家现在正看得精彩呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.76,0:18:33.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.43,0:18:36.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啦 我出去就是了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.87,0:18:38.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.11,0:18:41.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个孩子\N还敢问我什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.71,0:18:44.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 跟我过来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.14,0:18:46.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛喔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.21,0:18:48.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在走了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.38,0:18:49.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.42,0:18:50.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一放暑假
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.22,0:18:52.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事都不做就只知道玩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.49,0:18:53.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看你这么懒散
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.82,0:18:56.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开学之后肯定会很痛苦的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.76,0:18:58.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 赶快去写作业
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.72,0:19:03.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-听到了没有 -听到了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.80,0:19:15.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是疲劳轰炸
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.51,0:19:17.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.21,0:19:18.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.24,0:19:21.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不是随便就把\N预备袋里的鞋子拿出来用了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.65,0:19:24.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有我的允许\N你就随便把道具拿出来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.22,0:19:26.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万一发生事情的话\N该怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.05,0:19:28.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我错了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.02,0:19:32.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且刚才妈妈已经\N狠狠的骂了我一顿了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.03,0:19:36.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 既然你已经知道\N那就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.30,0:19:39.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.23,0:20:07.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.06,0:20:09.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么一直嗯个不停
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.70,0:20:11.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 我问你喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.46,0:20:13.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进到画册里的人\N一共是四个人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.00,0:20:16.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该没错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.27,0:20:17.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是四个人没有错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.80,0:20:19.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.54,0:20:20.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明是四个人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.84,0:20:23.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么这里只有三双鞋子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.74,0:20:26.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.25,0:20:29.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就表示了\N还有一个人没有回来耶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.92,0:20:30.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.05,0:20:32.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都已经回来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.99,0:20:37.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之我们先检查一下画册
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.62,0:20:39.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.33,0:20:41.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这还用问吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.10,0:20:47.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要仔细检查每一页\N看有没有在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.10,0:20:48.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的有人还没有回来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.57,0:20:50.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里没有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.37,0:20:56.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里也没有耶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.81,0:20:59.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样要找到什么时候啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.18,0:21:01.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.38,0:21:04.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.38,0:21:07.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你要去哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.42,0:21:08.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.35,0:21:11.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在直接去问本人\N不是会比较快吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.02,0:21:14.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦就是太爱操心了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.16,0:21:18.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以他的头上才会\N连一根毛都长不出来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.53,0:21:21.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们家小夫他不在耶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.77,0:21:24.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他失踪了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.37,0:21:25.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是失踪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.91,0:21:29.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是跟胖虎到后山\N去抓昆虫去了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.44,0:21:31.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吓了我一大跳
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.68,0:21:34.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 抓到了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.95,0:21:36.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 你怎么可以这样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.68,0:21:38.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我先发现的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.15,0:21:39.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 是我先抓到的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.89,0:21:41.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不服气啊 小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.45,0:21:43.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.36,0:21:45.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是大雄啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.42,0:21:46.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香她还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.96,0:21:48.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有什么不一样的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.79,0:21:52.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有啊\N没什么不一样的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.43,0:21:53.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.80,0:21:56.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然是哆啦A梦他搞错了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.60,0:21:58.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说静香她怎么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.80,0:22:00.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没…没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.18,0:22:06.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 你又怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.71,0:22:08.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们大家都已经回来啰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.71,0:22:10.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.52,0:22:12.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看一下天方夜谭这一页
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.92,0:22:14.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.59,0:22:15.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.19,0:22:18.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光一只鞋子根本就回不来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.72,0:22:21.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以说应该\N还有一个人没有回来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.96,0:22:25.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我刚才\N没有看到静香本人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.63,0:22:27.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.94,0:22:30.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.84,0:22:32.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一天到晚就只知道玩
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.84,0:22:34.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.91,0:22:38.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛 房间还是这么乱
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.68,0:22:40.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,气死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.11,0:22:44.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天非好好教训他一顿不可
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.39,0:22:48.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.52,0:22:50.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不可能会在的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.26,0:22:52.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们再确定一下\N这样比较好嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.66,0:22:54.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香她在不在
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.03,0:22:58.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.00,0:23:01.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本就不在嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.94,0:23:04.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂…我是哆啦A梦…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.04,0:23:06.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…我是阿源
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.67,0:23:07.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.54,0:23:09.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是钢琴老师啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.91,0:23:12.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 要去露营了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.28,0:23:12.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.95,0:23:17.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香她有点不太舒服\N所以不能去了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.65,0:23:20.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香她以为昨天是出发\N所以就出门去了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.69,0:23:22.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我找她到画册里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.15,0:23:24.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她妈妈一定以为她去露营了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.56,0:23:28.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是哆啦A梦跟大雄啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.29,0:23:29.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又有什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.33,0:23:30.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有 没事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.93,0:23:31.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.03,0:23:33.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.07,0:23:39.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 我们一定要快点\N把静香从画册里面救出来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.67,0:23:42.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能顺利的找到人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.51,0:23:47.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一整天就只知道看画册
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.48,0:23:50.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就可以给他一个惩罚了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.35,0:23:57.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们家怎么会冒烟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.13,0:24:01.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把画册烧掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.96,0:24:04.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太过份了\N你怎么可以随便烧我的书
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.50,0:24:05.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然是重要的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.76,0:24:07.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就更应该好好收好不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.87,0:24:09.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.37,0:24:10.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么可是不可是的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.80,0:24:11.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再说了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.74,0:24:14.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点去写功课听到没有
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.44,0:24:16.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.28,0:24:19.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦你快点想个办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.14,0:24:20.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连画册都没了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.28,0:24:21.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.81,0:24:24.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们坐时光机\N到远古的阿拉伯去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.98,0:24:26.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行啦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.32,0:24:29.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为时光机只能穿梭在\N真实的历史当中
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.96,0:24:32.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而画册的世界全都是虚构的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.83,0:24:35.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那怎么办静香还在里面耶
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.86,0:24:38.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在一点办法也没有了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.23,0:24:39.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不负责任
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.77,0:24:41.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不负责任的人是你
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.57,0:24:44.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事情会变成这样\N都是你惹出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.47,0:24:45.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.57,0:24:47.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我错了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.67,0:24:52.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干脆老实告诉静香的妈妈吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.31,0:24:53.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她一定没有办法接受
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.98,0:24:55.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毕竟静香是独生女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.92,0:24:58.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万一她悲伤过度寻短见的话
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.35,0:24:59.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许一听到这个消息
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.05,0:25:02.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会突然心脏病发作
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.06,0:25:04.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄怎么又是你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.06,0:25:07.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.56,0:25:12.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我根本说不出口
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.34,0:25:19.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道静香现在怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.07,0:25:24.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是当时我跟她一起出来\N就没事了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.84,0:25:28.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办哪…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.40,0:25:53.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求求你 放了我们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.75,0:26:01.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.61,0:26:04.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.42,0:26:08.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 不好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.19,0:26:10.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香她…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.49,0:26:12.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安静一点
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.42,0:26:15.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在正好有一个\N重要的资料要传过来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.69,0:26:17.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.33,0:26:21.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.67,0:26:23.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事情成功啦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.60,0:26:24.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了这个
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.70,0:26:26.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总算是有一点希望了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.67,0:26:27.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有希望了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.61,0:26:30.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天方夜谭总共收集了\N260个故事
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.61,0:26:34.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在想这些虚构的故事当中\N或许有一些是真实的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.65,0:26:38.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我就去查\N“宇宙完全大百科”
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.52,0:26:39.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.18,0:26:43.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果我查出来\N有两个人物是真实的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.42,0:26:44.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.79,0:26:49.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是哈伦阿尔拉席特王\N跟加法尔宰相这两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.66,0:26:52.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以只要我们\N去那个时代的阿拉伯
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.30,0:26:55.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许它跟其他故事\N是连接起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.17,0:26:57.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.37,0:26:58.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只好试试看了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.87,0:26:59.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.74,0:27:01.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说静香她…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.31,0:27:03.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的是真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.31,0:27:05.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两个愿意\N跟我们一起去找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.94,0:27:08.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们当然要去啰
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.38,0:27:10.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的这个方法可靠吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.72,0:27:11.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们可以放心
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.12,0:27:15.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经找了\N专业的导游机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.12,0:27:19.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦什梦 让您久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.39,0:27:20.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妖怪出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.43,0:27:21.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不是妖怪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.96,0:27:24.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是时间旅行社的米库金
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.83,0:27:25.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.43,0:27:26.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦什梦
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.40,0:27:27.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.63,0:27:28.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.03,0:27:30.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是你
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.24,0:27:34.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是什么哆啦什梦\N是哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.94,0:27:36.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.94,0:27:39.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天非常感谢各位
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.41,0:27:42.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,参加本公司所举办\N的天方夜谭之旅
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.48,0:27:45.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实这个天方夜谭呢\N也就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.65,0:27:46.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 你不要再说明了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.05,0:27:48.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.55,0:27:49.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.66,0:27:52.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说明行程\N也是我们的工作之一
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.09,0:27:54.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过这个就要\N请你们配合一下了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.76,0:27:57.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先是\N“一天就学会阿拉伯会话”
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.86,0:27:59.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个不用了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.26,0:28:00.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有翻译蒟蒻
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.60,0:28:02.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然哆啦什梦自备那就算了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.84,0:28:04.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫做哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.70,0:28:07.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么各位请换装吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.81,0:28:10.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们一个是外国贸易商人\N一个是他的秘书
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.04,0:28:14.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两个则是他的仆人
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.21,0:28:16.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么我们要当仆人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.22,0:28:17.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不是在赶时间吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.85,0:28:20.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要抱怨了\N快点把衣服换上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.69,0:28:21.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.29,0:28:22.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很适合这样的打扮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.89,0:28:24.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.69,0:28:27.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.19,0:28:29.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们两个也要当商人啦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.56,0:28:30.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.00,0:28:33.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我觉得\N你的长相不太适合
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.40,0:28:34.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的长相又怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.63,0:28:38.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的长相比他看起来\N还更像是人耶
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.80,0:28:39.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.64,0:28:40.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备出发啰
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.01,0:28:42.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下啦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.07,0:28:44.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底是要去还是不要去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.54,0:28:46.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,废话 我当然要去啰
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.48,0:28:49.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 那就快点出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.75,0:28:53.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个是古代型的机器
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.85,0:28:54.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.79,0:28:55.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能动就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.02,0:28:58.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊 快点走啦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.72,0:28:59.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.39,0:29:04.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在就要前往\N794年的巴格达
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.06,0:29:06.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太快了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.33,0:29:08.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不是急着\N要赶快去那个地方吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.93,0:29:10.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托 你会不会开呀
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.84,0:29:12.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.27,0:29:13.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是专家耶
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.91,0:29:17.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,794年刚好是\N日本的平安时代
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.84,0:29:20.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是桓武天皇\N将首都迁到京都的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.91,0:29:22.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不用解释那么多了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.95,0:29:23.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.82,0:29:25.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要将日本的历史\N对照一下才行
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.82,0:29:28.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要再说那么多废话
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.56,0:29:34.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.43,0:29:35.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经到了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.63,0:29:37.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么这么粗鲁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.93,0:29:39.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位请看
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.30,0:29:43.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就是794年的巴格达
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.11,0:29:52.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前面这条河\N就是有名的底格里斯河
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.48,0:29:53.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中央是圆城
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.95,0:29:57.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在三重的城壁中\N有皇宫跟寺院
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.05,0:30:00.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴格达的人口有200万人
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.45,0:30:03.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这个时代\N世界上最大的都市
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.06,0:30:05.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顺道一提的是
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.39,0:30:07.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日本正值平安时代初期\N首都…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.89,0:30:10.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个你刚才就已经提过了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.30,0:30:12.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不需要再做解说了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.30,0:30:14.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直跟历史老师\N出来旅行一样
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.73,0:30:15.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很烦耶
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.73,0:30:16.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.10,0:30:20.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正我的解说\N对你们来说一点意思也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.74,0:30:23.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是个三流的导游
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.71,0:30:26.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他好像生气了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.58,0:30:28.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要理他了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.65,0:30:32.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重要的是接下来该怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.53,0:30:44.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真糟糕 阿拉伯世界这么大
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.43,0:30:47.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要怎么样才能够找到静香呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.47,0:30:50.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是梦到她在奴隶船上耶
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.00,0:30:53.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做的梦也不一定准啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.51,0:30:56.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然这样\N我们就用阿拉伯的方式来找
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.74,0:30:58.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.14,0:30:59.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿拉伯世界不是有神灯
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.71,0:31:02.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有瓶中的魔神吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.89,0:31:09.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是能用魔毯就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.22,0:31:09.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.06,0:31:11.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快把那些道具拿出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.86,0:31:13.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们真是有够笨的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.49,0:31:15.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么神灯\N还有在空中飞的魔毯
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.03,0:31:17.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些全都是虚构的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.00,0:31:20.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米库金你这家伙真的很烦耶
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.00,0:31:22.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嫌我烦
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.50,0:31:25.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了 那你们就自己看着办
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.47,0:31:28.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个导游\N真是太没有责任感了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.04,0:31:32.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.94,0:31:35.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这四位朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.28,0:31:38.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我劝你们最好不要野宿喔
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.88,0:31:41.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 你快点想想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.65,0:31:42.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.06,0:31:46.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这个地方野宿是很危险的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.49,0:31:47.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.83,0:31:49.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的名字叫做哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.59,0:31:51.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下再打招呼好了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.90,0:31:55.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来会有危险发生喔
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.97,0:32:02.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是最可怕的沙漠毒蝎团
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.77,0:32:05.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想保命就把钱留下来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.31,0:32:09.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天啊 这是40大盗耶
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.19,0:32:17.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是亲卫队
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.76,0:32:20.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.29,0:32:25.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兄弟们 大家撤退
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.07,0:32:34.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕 我们被包围了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.31,0:32:38.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这些可恶的沙漠毒虫
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.78,0:32:41.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个不剩的全都给我抓起来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.98,0:32:45.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.89,0:32:47.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.02,0:32:50.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.32,0:32:54.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些骑兵队好厉害喔\N太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.16,0:32:59.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的强盗全部都抓住了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.07,0:33:02.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这次表现得非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.10,0:33:03.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是有一点非常遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.07,0:33:06.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是让首领卡西姆给逃掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.24,0:33:07.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.37,0:33:09.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就下令全国通缉
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.78,0:33:12.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了让百姓\N有安居乐业的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.48,0:33:15.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要把这个恶徒\N给铲除掉才行
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.85,0:33:16.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.92,0:33:18.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我们回宫吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.35,0:33:19.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.85,0:33:23.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们几位今天\N就到我的皇宫休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.86,0:33:25.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.36,0:33:29.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请告诉我们你的大名是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.19,0:33:33.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫做哈伦阿尔拉席特
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.37,0:33:37.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来你是\N哈伦阿尔拉席特王啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.77,0:33:40.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.53,0:34:03.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天晚上睡得还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.36,0:34:04.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.53,0:34:07.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我们最危急的时候\N挺身相救
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.60,0:34:10.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老实说\N这次能够逮到这些恶徒
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.70,0:34:13.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还真多亏了\N有你们这几位诱饵呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.67,0:34:16.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请问你们是从哪来的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.51,0:34:20.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的名字叫做阿卜哆啦\N我是个日本商人
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.68,0:34:22.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而他是我的秘书阿里
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.81,0:34:23.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿里
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.42,0:34:24.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 我是阿里
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.92,0:34:29.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,旁边这两个是我的仆人\N哈桑跟库玛桑
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.35,0:34:30.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忍耐要忍耐
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.92,0:34:31.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日本…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.86,0:34:33.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从来没有听过这个国家
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.89,0:34:38.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是比印度跟中国\N还要更东边的一个岛国
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.23,0:34:39.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.26,0:34:41.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比中国还要东边的国家啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.60,0:34:44.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们为什么要从\N那么远的地方来这呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.74,0:34:48.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我们是来这里找人的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.21,0:34:53.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我梦见\N她被坏人抓上了奴隶船
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.61,0:34:54.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奴隶船
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.85,0:34:55.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那还真是糟糕耶
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.08,0:34:59.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,底格里斯河的河口附近\N有个巴斯拉港
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.42,0:35:02.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里聚集了\N来自世界各地的船只
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.02,0:35:05.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去那里可能会找到线索喔
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.16,0:35:07.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 我们赶快去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.46,0:35:09.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的签名通行证
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.46,0:35:11.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许能够帮得上你们一点忙
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.86,0:35:13.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们就收下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.73,0:35:16.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王陛下真的很谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.20,0:35:53.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点来买啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.71,0:35:55.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,便宜啊 快来买
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.37,0:35:56.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快喔
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.47,0:35:59.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,印度进口的茶叶 来看看喔
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.95,0:36:01.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中国进口的丝绸喔
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.68,0:36:05.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生 你摸摸看\N就知道质感绝佳
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.15,0:36:08.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看过这个女孩子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.02,0:36:11.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可爱的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.52,0:36:13.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是奴隶吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.22,0:36:15.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许她现在已经是奴隶了…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.56,0:36:16.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想买耶
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.43,0:36:18.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪里买得到 多少钱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.53,0:36:20.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不是卖的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.83,0:36:23.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那张画也卖给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.40,0:36:26.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没看过耶
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.14,0:36:28.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道喔
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.21,0:36:33.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看样子要找人真的很困难
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.15,0:36:35.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看过她喔
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.01,0:36:37.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.45,0:36:40.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么时候看到她的\N她在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.09,0:36:42.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.12,0:36:45.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是在30年前吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.42,0:36:47.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.68,0:37:08.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再这样下去\N永远都找不到的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.75,0:37:13.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是除了这样\N已经没有别的办法了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.65,0:37:16.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.09,0:37:18.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈桑跟库玛桑呢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.44,0:37:32.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.24,0:37:34.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们怎么跑来这里摸鱼了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.17,0:37:36.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们找得好累喔
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.44,0:37:37.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管问谁
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.24,0:37:40.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人的回答都是\N不知道 没看过
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.88,0:37:42.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老伯
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.25,0:37:44.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也没看过这个女孩子\N对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.95,0:37:46.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看过
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.32,0:37:47.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.39,0:37:49.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是这样回答的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.72,0:37:51.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看过她…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.79,0:37:53.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在哪里…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.03,0:37:55.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在10天前
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.49,0:37:57.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一艘奴隶船往东方开去
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.00,0:38:00.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个女孩就是其中一个
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.63,0:38:01.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 是静香…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.03,0:38:03.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是静香…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.23,0:38:04.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点追上去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.07,0:38:06.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要怎么追
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.91,0:38:10.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我倒是可以给你们一个建议
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.11,0:38:13.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干脆你们也买一艘船
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.08,0:38:15.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,买一艘船
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.95,0:38:18.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.15,0:38:21.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之不快点决定的话\N静香她就…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.52,0:38:22.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.42,0:38:24.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有这个时代的钱币吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.29,0:38:27.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以从宇宙和平银行领到钱
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.43,0:38:28.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,考虑的如何啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.09,0:38:31.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚好有一艘船要卖
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.53,0:38:33.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要帮你们介绍一下
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.57,0:38:36.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊 那就拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.57,0:38:44.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这简直是一艘幽灵船嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.04,0:38:47.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这艘船真的能用吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.51,0:38:51.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来好像丢在这边很久了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.35,0:38:54.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是不赶快追上去的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.52,0:38:57.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朋友们\N我可以帮你们找船员
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.76,0:39:00.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 我们马上出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.56,0:39:02.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那艘船的人
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.89,0:39:06.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有许可就出海是违法的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.90,0:39:09.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的目的地是哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.73,0:39:10.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目的地…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.70,0:39:12.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在还不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.57,0:39:14.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,船上装的是什么货物
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.71,0:39:15.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,船员的名单呢
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.81,0:39:19.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事情这么紧急怎么去准备啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.18,0:39:21.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才那个老伯跑到哪里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.21,0:39:22.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这群人很可疑
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.31,0:39:24.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他们通通抓回去调查
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.22,0:39:26.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你们先等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.65,0:39:28.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有这个东西
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.92,0:39:30.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.52,0:39:32.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是通行证
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.49,0:39:35.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是阿尔拉席特陛下\N的亲笔签名
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.79,0:39:37.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.23,0:39:38.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上我们得到消息
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.06,0:39:42.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,据说有一个叫卡西姆的盗匪\N要潜逃到国外去
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.90,0:39:44.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请原谅我们
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.37,0:39:45.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.50,0:39:47.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们随时都可以出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.44,0:39:49.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你们一路上要小心
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.17,0:39:51.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告辞
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.28,0:39:56.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚刚还以为我们完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.78,0:39:59.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个老伯到底跑到哪里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.92,0:40:02.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.89,0:40:06.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,船主
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.96,0:40:08.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,船员我都帮你找来了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.93,0:40:12.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接着只要准备一些\N粮食跟饮水
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.20,0:40:15.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就可以出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.40,0:40:18.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么看起来全都是一副\N凶神恶煞的样子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.70,0:40:20.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在已经没有时间挑剔了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.77,0:40:21.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.71,0:40:24.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备出发
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.39,0:40:34.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.55,0:40:36.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在就要去救你了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.82,0:40:38.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你再忍耐一下
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.76,0:40:41.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香 你一定要撑下去
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.63,0:40:43.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要撑下去喔
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.27,0:40:50.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这艘船的速度\N怎么会这么慢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.10,0:40:52.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.00,0:40:54.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可不可以再快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.94,0:40:57.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帆船是要靠风力的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.18,0:41:00.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有强风也没用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.35,0:41:04.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 你想想办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.25,0:41:06.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要强风是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.35,0:41:10.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,风神扇
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.69,0:41:15.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 你长得最壮了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.36,0:41:16.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来扇风吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.83,0:41:19.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.13,0:41:25.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太强了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.20,0:41:27.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,船快毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.88,0:41:32.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 这样太强了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.81,0:41:36.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强度要适中才行
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.35,0:41:40.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的身上有奇怪的道具耶
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.26,0:41:53.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经航行一段时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.83,0:41:57.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里可能是波斯湾的中央喔
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.90,0:42:00.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是没有看到\N静香搭的那艘船耶
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.97,0:42:03.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们早在10天之前就离港了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.64,0:42:06.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会这么快就追上的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.48,0:42:09.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先去睡觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.35,0:42:11.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也去
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.32,0:42:16.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里好像是船舱耶
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.65,0:42:18.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面好暗喔
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.26,0:42:24.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.96,0:42:25.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.70,0:42:28.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面破破烂烂的\N到处都是灰尘
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.23,0:42:31.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种地方怎么睡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.17,0:42:33.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虫式睡袋
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.91,0:42:35.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法我们就睡这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.04,0:42:37.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.21,0:42:38.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.54,0:42:40.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.85,0:42:45.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他肚子上的口袋\N好像有什么秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.64,0:43:10.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.71,0:43:15.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.65,0:43:19.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.42,0:43:25.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.29,0:43:25.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.02,0:43:27.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.59,0:43:30.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们好像被丢到大海里了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.47,0:43:38.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样船主你们都醒了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.34,0:43:40.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这是做什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.87,0:43:43.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们四个人跟你又无冤无仇
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.74,0:43:47.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这几个真是笨蛋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.81,0:43:51.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞不清楚状况啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.42,0:43:53.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是盗贼卡西姆耶
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.28,0:43:58.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多亏有你们几位的帮忙\N我们才可以潜逃出来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.59,0:44:01.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实在太卑鄙了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.36,0:44:03.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.93,0:44:06.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要给你们好看…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.26,0:44:08.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碰上我卡西姆还能够活命
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.50,0:44:11.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们应该要很庆幸了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.81,0:44:20.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 我们该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.01,0:44:24.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手脚都出不来了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.56,0:44:35.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看样子好像有暴风雨要来了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.67,0:44:43.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.60,0:44:45.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.50,0:44:47.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快想办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.54,0:44:51.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.31,0:44:53.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.88,0:44:56.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才怪
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.85,0:44:59.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.14,0:45:22.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天晚上的暴风雨\N好像一场梦
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.24,0:45:23.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.57,0:45:25.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那绝对不是梦
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.01,0:45:28.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一个红红的\N像火球的东西飞过来
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.48,0:45:30.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把昏过去的我们\N一个个送上岸来
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.65,0:45:32.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.12,0:45:34.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我绝对没有骗你们啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.42,0:45:36.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说是火球救了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.79,0:45:40.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪会有这么离谱的事情\N你少胡说了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.36,0:45:42.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是真的看到了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.26,0:45:45.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还敢跟我辩 臭小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.43,0:45:48.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要吵了啦\N反正都得救了不是很好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.63,0:45:50.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点也不好
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.70,0:45:52.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦你认为怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.60,0:45:54.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我判断这应该是幻觉
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.97,0:45:56.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是这是真实的话
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.44,0:46:01.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那很可能就是我们闯入了\N虚构跟现实世界的夹缝中了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.55,0:46:04.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦\N那么你的意思是说
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.58,0:46:06.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来到天方夜谭的世界啰
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.62,0:46:08.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们快点去救静香吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.22,0:46:09.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧 快点走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.79,0:46:11.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.62,0:46:12.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要去哪里啊 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.09,0:46:15.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前面是大海而后面是沙漠耶
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.03,0:46:19.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我们还是要离开这里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.33,0:46:21.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看目前这个情况
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.63,0:46:25.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是我的道具\N派上用场的时候了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.34,0:46:27.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 我们就是在等这个
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.04,0:46:29.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是哆啦A梦最可靠了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.81,0:46:31.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 真是太酷了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.41,0:46:33.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.15,0:46:39.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪了 不见了…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.82,0:46:42.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的口袋不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.79,0:46:44.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.16,0:46:45.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不是开玩笑的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.96,0:46:47.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打算怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.36,0:46:48.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有口袋的哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.79,0:46:50.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只不过是个\N破旧的机器猫而已
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.76,0:46:52.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.23,0:46:55.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这几个人\N有必要批评到这种程度吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.27,0:46:57.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的什么都没有了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.10,0:47:00.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你身上会不会\N还会有什么样的道具
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.61,0:47:01.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.57,0:47:02.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有什么东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.71,0:47:06.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前米库金给我的帽子\N因为大小不合所以我没有戴
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.04,0:47:09.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就戴上了我自己的帽子
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.68,0:47:10.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.48,0:47:12.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少还留下了一样东西
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.62,0:47:15.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么样的道具呢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.52,0:47:17.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这根羽毛可以变成笛子喔
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.02,0:47:20.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后呢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.20,0:47:32.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个就是可以变成\N很多花样的万能头巾
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.50,0:47:34.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.24,0:47:36.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.24,0:47:39.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.34,0:47:40.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.11,0:47:42.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要生气啦\N胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.13,0:47:59.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这样漫无目的走\N要走到什么时候啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.70,0:48:01.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪是漫无目地啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.23,0:48:04.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一直朝着北方前进耶
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.78,0:48:14.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要慢吞吞的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.85,0:48:18.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点跟上来 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.85,0:48:21.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…我的脚好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.22,0:48:23.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是有竹蜻蜓的话就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.75,0:48:26.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好想用飞的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.19,0:48:27.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望有万能水龙头
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.86,0:48:29.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它就可以穿过地底下的水脉
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.79,0:48:30.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么一来的话
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.73,0:48:34.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就可以喝到\N冰冰凉凉的水了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.93,0:48:37.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还是觉得美食桌巾最棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.07,0:48:40.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是拉面还是猪排饭
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.60,0:48:43.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想吃什么就有什么
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.67,0:48:46.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们说这个\N是要故意激怒我的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.08,0:48:48.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.15,0:48:49.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是这样你能怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.81,0:48:50.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不服气啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.72,0:48:52.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,臭矮冬瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.45,0:48:54.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 你们不要再吵了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.59,0:48:56.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来这里的目的\N是要救静香的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.05,0:49:00.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道你们都忘记了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.83,0:49:02.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.29,0:49:04.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都怪我太急躁了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.20,0:49:05.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也有不对
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.56,0:49:09.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这全都是那个卡西姆害的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.30,0:49:12.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡西姆那一艘破船\N绝对承受不了那场暴风雨的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.94,0:49:15.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许他们也被\N冲到这个岸上来喔
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.71,0:49:18.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我们一样徘徊在沙漠中呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.71,0:49:19.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果真是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.71,0:49:21.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我绝饶不了他们
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.18,0:49:26.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.42,0:49:27.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.32,0:49:29.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再给我们喝口水好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.42,0:49:30.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.02,0:49:34.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N为什么一直要喝水呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.73,0:49:36.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天晚上那场暴风雨
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.69,0:49:38.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是让你们\N喝得够多海水了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.90,0:49:41.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海水怎么喝呀
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.27,0:49:44.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像还剩下一些吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.84,0:49:50.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经空空的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.04,0:49:53.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很不巧 没有了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.44,0:49:54.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老大 你真过份
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.91,0:49:56.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不要命了 是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.81,0:49:57.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.12,0:50:00.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这里还有个更好的东西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.48,0:50:02.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个袋子\N可以实现任何的愿望
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.85,0:50:03.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.92,0:50:05.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要水 我要喝水
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.52,0:50:07.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想吃东西 我要吃东西
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.83,0:50:08.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.06,0:50:11.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先找水啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.06,0:50:13.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.46,0:50:14.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要水…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.13,0:50:18.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要水 你要食物是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.31,0:50:23.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样 好吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.27,0:50:25.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老大 根本一滴水都没有嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.71,0:50:26.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.58,0:50:28.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是在捉弄我们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.81,0:50:29.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一等
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.58,0:50:32.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来找会飞的道具
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.18,0:50:34.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.59,0:50:45.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好蠢喔
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.57,0:50:52.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经不想\N再当你的部下了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.74,0:50:54.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟着你碰到的都是倒楣事
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.77,0:50:55.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.74,0:50:58.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你们想走的话尽管走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.94,0:51:01.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还真是求之不得呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.71,0:51:06.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亏我原本还想带你们两个\N去黄金宫殿的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.52,0:51:08.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黄金宫殿
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.35,0:51:09.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.42,0:51:13.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这个沙漠的某个深处\N有个黄金宫殿
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.32,0:51:16.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说这个宫殿里头\N全都摆满了黄金宝物
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.96,0:51:20.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且听说只有一个国王\N在守着那些东西
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.07,0:51:23.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这听起来像是梦话嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.60,0:51:25.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁相信这种事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.44,0:51:29.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我一个从事\N奴隶买卖的朋友告诉我的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.94,0:51:32.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他也为了独占那些宝物
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.38,0:51:35.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正在赶往黄金宫殿\N的路途中吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.25,0:51:36.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们给我听好了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.51,0:51:38.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原本我是打算占领那个宫殿
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.05,0:51:40.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来当王
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.28,0:51:42.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两个就来当我的大臣
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.39,0:51:45.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然你们这么说那就算了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.16,0:51:46.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老大…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.76,0:51:49.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们快点消失
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.56,0:51:50.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.03,0:51:52.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请让我们跟着你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.90,0:51:53.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老大 拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.10,0:51:54.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啰唆\N老大
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.03,0:51:56.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随你们去
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.81,0:52:06.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 看到什么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.78,0:52:07.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有湖耶
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.91,0:52:09.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像海一样大的湖耶
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.65,0:52:11.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们快看
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.08,0:52:14.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那边…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.62,0:52:15.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有水可以喝了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.75,0:52:17.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定要给它喝个够
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.99,0:52:21.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的头巾还是发挥功效了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.57,0:52:28.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.53,0:52:31.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的湖在哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.50,0:52:33.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得是在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.77,0:52:36.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果跑到哪去了 天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.68,0:52:38.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.91,0:52:40.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一定是海市蜃楼
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.88,0:52:42.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海市蜃楼
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.35,0:52:43.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这都是光在作祟
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.95,0:52:46.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们看到\N根本就不存在的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.58,0:52:47.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.48,0:52:49.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.02,0:52:50.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.99,0:52:54.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一下子说火球\N现在又是海市蜃楼
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.12,0:52:56.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的眼睛是用来唬人的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.13,0:52:57.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你给我听好了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.19,0:52:57.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从现在开始
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.03,0:53:00.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管看到什么东西\N都给我闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.20,0:53:01.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.03,0:53:03.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.87,0:53:05.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.10,0:53:06.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.30,0:53:07.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.91,0:53:08.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.04,0:53:10.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有路的地方你也会迷路
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.04,0:53:13.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还真是个天才啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.04,0:53:15.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.08,0:53:17.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.88,0:53:21.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你要撑着点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.09,0:53:21.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.05,0:53:24.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕 好像中暑了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.09,0:53:24.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.69,0:53:26.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把他抬到阴暗的地方去\N好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.86,0:53:28.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.83,0:53:29.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.36,0:53:30.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定要撑住
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.76,0:53:32.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去那边 有阴影耶
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.33,0:53:33.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.87,0:53:37.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.43,0:53:38.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是绿洲吗
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.07,0:53:41.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.04,0:53:44.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那肯定又是海市蜃楼
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.51,0:53:47.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的眼睛真的不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.81,0:54:21.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你该起来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.81,0:54:24.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再让我洗一下好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.62,0:54:28.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还是第一次碰到\N像你这么爱干净的女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.32,0:54:29.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.32,0:54:32.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁叫你是我\N最后一棵摇钱树呢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.52,0:54:33.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.62,0:54:39.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有想到会那么倒楣\N碰上个那么大的暴风雨
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.13,0:54:43.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得让黄金宫殿的国王\N出个高价才可以
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.64,0:54:52.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把自己弄得干净一点\N漂亮一点喔
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.31,0:54:56.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.91,0:54:58.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也洗得差不多了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.68,0:55:01.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再洗下去连皮都会洗破的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.32,0:55:08.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.86,0:55:09.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回来
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.03,0:55:12.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被她跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.17,0:55:17.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对她好一点 竟然得寸进尺
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.77,0:55:21.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓回来之后一定要\N好好的修理她一顿不可
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.17,0:55:22.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.48,0:55:31.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干嘛突然间停下来
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.19,0:55:40.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕 是沙尘暴
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.69,0:55:45.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.71,0:56:32.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多亏了我有这条万能头巾
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.21,0:56:35.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮的星星喔
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.31,0:56:36.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.05,0:56:38.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你不要紧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.85,0:56:40.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像已经退烧了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.58,0:56:43.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是有水就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.13,0:56:56.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少涌出一点水也好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.65,0:57:10.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快来呀
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.48,0:57:12.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.55,0:57:14.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们快听我说…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.29,0:57:17.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了 不要说了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.86,0:57:20.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的眼睛根本看不准
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.70,0:57:28.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家全部都已经累垮了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.52,0:57:53.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么天气一直都这么好
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.32,0:57:53.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.89,0:57:55.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.33,0:57:57.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快把我给累死了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.16,0:58:00.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我们又不能\N把大雄给丢下啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.36,0:58:03.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然胖虎平常看起来很粗暴
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.33,0:58:05.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是却是个重友情的人
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.10,0:58:06.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.00,0:58:10.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会不好意思的 小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.34,0:58:14.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实胖虎他这个人…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.68,0:58:19.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N怎么连我的耳朵都不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.13,0:58:33.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,眼睛不行这下连耳朵也坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.46,0:58:34.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.20,0:58:34.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.56,0:58:37.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不快逃你想被踩扁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.73,0:58:39.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是真啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.44,0:58:40.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.21,0:58:46.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.14,0:58:49.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是真的来到\N天方夜谭的世界了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.31,0:58:52.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少也该让我们\N安稳的进去嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.85,0:58:55.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 救救我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.75,0:58:57.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.89,0:58:59.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.39,0:59:05.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.93,0:59:07.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我 听到没有
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.40,0:59:10.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开 快点放我下去
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.21,0:59:18.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来他好像\N不是要把我们吃掉的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.91,0:59:20.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要把我们带到哪里去
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.71,0:59:24.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的速度\N怎么越来越快了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.12,0:59:34.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果世界真的有尽头的话
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.86,0:59:36.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能就是这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.93,0:59:40.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地平线的那一端在发亮耶
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.27,0:59:48.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是黄金宫殿耶
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.96,1:00:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好壮观喔
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.83,1:00:21.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 天啊\N好漂亮的庭院喔
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.24,1:00:25.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有小鸟美妙的歌声\N还有到处绽放的花朵
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.28,1:00:27.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喷水池流出水晶般清澈的水
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.08,1:00:28.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是水耶
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.05,1:00:30.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 有水了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.65,1:00:31.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点喝水
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.78,1:00:33.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的水耶
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.82,1:00:36.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.19,1:00:38.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点起来 喝水
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.32,1:00:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你没事了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.52,1:00:41.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.56,1:00:43.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你总算是恢复精神了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.46,1:00:45.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.26,1:00:47.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这家伙就是爱让人操心
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.93,1:00:53.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快喝水
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.78,1:01:01.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.51,1:01:04.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么擅自闯进来这里呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.02,1:01:08.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狮子会说话耶
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.85,1:01:10.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.66,1:01:17.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我们自己闯进来的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.09,1:01:20.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是大魔神带我们来这里的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.23,1:01:23.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.60,1:01:25.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吓到你们几位了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.54,1:01:26.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是对不起啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.04,1:01:30.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为已经很久\N没有客人来造访了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.44,1:01:33.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我故意跟你们闹一下
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.24,1:01:34.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫做辛巴达
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.54,1:01:36.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这个宫殿的国王
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.11,1:01:38.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家叫我水手辛巴达
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.58,1:01:40.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说\N那个航海冒险的辛巴达啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.02,1:01:42.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉一点都不像
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.45,1:01:44.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说这里\N真的是天方夜谭了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.06,1:01:46.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天方夜谭
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.06,1:01:48.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么意思啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.93,1:01:52.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这段故事\N是在后来的时代才完成的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.76,1:01:53.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.46,1:01:55.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能不能请问你一下
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.33,1:01:56.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.60,1:01:57.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是想问我
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.57,1:02:00.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个人住在这里\N不会寂寞是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.60,1:02:02.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我身边有很多的宝物
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.87,1:02:04.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每天过得非常的快乐
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.94,1:02:06.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我让你们看看我的宝物吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.88,1:02:07.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.54,1:02:10.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我们想问的是…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.40,1:02:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信大雄 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.30,1:02:31.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟胖虎 小夫\N一定会来救我的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.21,1:02:38.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.01,1:02:41.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个新的脚印
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.11,1:02:43.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大小看起来\N是那个奴隶的没错
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.41,1:02:44.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.41,1:02:47.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来我的运气\N还是相当不错的耶
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.45,1:02:48.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.09,1:02:54.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会飞的木马
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.76,1:02:57.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是因为\N在夜晚的沙漠上看到你们
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.03,1:03:00.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才会把你们几位带到这来的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.83,1:03:01.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.93,1:03:03.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很感谢您的搭救
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.77,1:03:04.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.57,1:03:05.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事情是这样的啦
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.94,1:03:07.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们想请问你的是…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.00,1:03:08.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.47,1:03:11.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那个魔神的真实身份是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.64,1:03:13.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就在这个瓶子里面
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.68,1:03:17.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当他一到外面来\N就会变成巨大的魔神
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.18,1:03:20.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会听从帮他打开瓶盖的人
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.15,1:03:22.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是就是因为力量太大了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.29,1:03:25.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使唤起来还有点费力呢
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.72,1:03:27.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有像这个
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.49,1:03:29.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他比较弱小一点
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.79,1:03:33.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快点问他\N关于静香的事情啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.16,1:03:35.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最好使唤的是这个神灯
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.47,1:03:38.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 你来摩擦它一下
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.74,1:03:46.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什么
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.51,1:03:48.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大白天还在睡觉
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.65,1:03:51.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 主人
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.48,1:03:53.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我马上就去办
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.72,1:04:03.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连问都没问就跑出去了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.69,1:04:06.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是这样冒冒失失的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.90,1:04:07.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.63,1:04:09.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为这个问题很重要
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.63,1:04:11.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们之所以\N千里迢迢的来到阿拉伯
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.90,1:04:13.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是要找这个女孩…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.64,1:04:16.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是要找这个女孩子啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.37,1:04:18.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么不早一点说呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.28,1:04:19.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.14,1:04:20.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道她吗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.74,1:04:22.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们跟我来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.88,1:04:25.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种事就是要赶快问
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.75,1:04:26.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来她已经在这里了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.05,1:04:28.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.06,1:04:34.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我收集了\N很多可爱的女孩子喔
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.56,1:04:36.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说收集
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.43,1:04:39.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啦 大家都出来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.91,1:04:56.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要常常给她们上紧发条
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.55,1:04:58.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的好麻烦喔
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.25,1:05:00.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.23,1:05:09.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.73,1:05:11.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么不跑快一点啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.76,1:05:12.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快跑啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.03,1:05:14.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.73,1:05:16.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快一点
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.90,1:05:19.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,臭丫头
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.67,1:05:23.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道你真的以为\N逃得出我的手掌心啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.84,1:05:28.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的鞭子可是不长眼睛的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.28,1:05:30.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不但皮肉会绽开\N还会血流不止喔
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.68,1:05:32.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想挨打吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.85,1:05:37.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个叫做士兵的种子
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.62,1:05:39.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把这个种子种下去的话
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.82,1:05:43.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一颗颗的种子\N就会长出士兵来了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.09,1:05:45.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主人
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.60,1:05:46.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.83,1:05:49.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经绕了沙漠一圈了耶
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.97,1:05:52.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道您吩咐什么事情
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.17,1:05:54.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是个冒失鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.11,1:05:57.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.11,1:06:01.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 我想起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.28,1:06:05.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚才在沙漠上看到\N一个男的在追一个女孩
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.28,1:06:07.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是静香…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.15,1:06:08.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在沙漠里的哪个地方啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.79,1:06:10.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个女孩穿什么样的衣服啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.92,1:06:11.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她逃掉了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.12,1:06:13.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个男的是什么样子啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.72,1:06:14.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.52,1:06:18.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的朋友\N被奴隶商给抓走了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.53,1:06:20.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是糟糕啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.20,1:06:21.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么都没说呢
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.60,1:06:24.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你不给我们机会说啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.20,1:06:26.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞天魔毯
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.97,1:06:31.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的收集品当中\N最宝贝的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.88,1:06:33.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们上来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.64,1:06:35.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要出发了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.82,1:06:43.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.65,1:06:46.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一次一定会找到你的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.70,1:06:53.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别看我这样
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.90,1:06:56.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我是个很慈悲的人
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.40,1:07:00.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你肯答应我\N我以后一定会相信你的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.70,1:07:04.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快说\N主人我绝对不会再逃走了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.27,1:07:05.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点说
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.84,1:07:09.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有办法跟你承诺\N这种违背我本意的话
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.98,1:07:10.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.75,1:07:12.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还真是顽强啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.98,1:07:15.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的要我动手吗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.32,1:07:17.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.65,1:07:19.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你们真的都来了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.86,1:07:22.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们马上过去救你喔
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.20,1:07:28.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在立刻\N把这个女孩交给我
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.47,1:07:28.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是不放了她
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.93,1:07:31.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们绝对要你好看
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.23,1:07:32.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听你们鬼扯
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.40,1:07:35.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她可是我重要的财产呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.31,1:07:37.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶的家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.94,1:07:41.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不快还来
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.68,1:07:43.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就凭你们还早得很呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.28,1:07:44.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们也不打听看看
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.55,1:07:49.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我阿布基鲁\N可是恶名昭彰的恶徒呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.09,1:07:52.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点放开那个女孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.96,1:07:53.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.62,1:07:55.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.56,1:08:00.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.80,1:08:04.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么东西啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.37,1:08:07.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.34,1:08:09.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要过来
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.21,1:08:10.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要过来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.88,1:08:23.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都来了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.62,1:08:24.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.75,1:08:26.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.26,1:08:28.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.19,1:08:29.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.63,1:08:30.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直相信
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.49,1:08:33.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信\N你们一定会来救我的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.70,1:08:34.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.06,1:08:37.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真的是太好了耶
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.40,1:08:40.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来你还在干这种坏勾当啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.57,1:08:42.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前你在沙漠昏倒的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.71,1:08:45.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道你忘了是谁救你的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.78,1:08:47.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小的不曾忘记啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.28,1:08:48.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了报答您的救命之恩
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.91,1:08:53.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才大老远的带了这个\N可爱的女孩子要奉献给您的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.15,1:08:54.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的真心
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.72,1:08:55.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.02,1:08:58.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然连贩卖人口\N这种事你也做得出来
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.02,1:09:00.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太可恶了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.36,1:09:02.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 各位朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.86,1:09:04.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在回宫殿去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.86,1:09:06.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.30,1:09:10.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,士兵种子 现在给我回来
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.54,1:09:15.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啦
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.87,1:09:17.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.44,1:09:18.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王陛下
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.24,1:09:20.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请您大发慈悲\N带我一起回宫去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.81,1:09:21.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陛下
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.44,1:09:23.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.51,1:09:24.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王陛下
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.38,1:09:26.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您不能把我一个人\N留在这里啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.62,1:09:28.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陛下
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.12,1:09:29.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陛下
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.19,1:09:30.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你欺负静香
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.39,1:09:33.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是给你的惩罚
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.32,1:09:35.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那您想杀了我吗
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.89,1:09:39.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是给你的饮水还有食物
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.53,1:09:41.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别再让我看到你啦
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.97,1:09:43.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.03,1:09:45.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们给我记住
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.34,1:09:47.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然这样对待本大爷
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.40,1:09:49.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这笔帐我一定\N要你们加倍奉还
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.07,1:09:53.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然我就不是阿布基鲁
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.99,1:10:12.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样衣服适合我吗
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.73,1:10:13.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮喔
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.73,1:10:15.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像阿拉伯公主喔
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.67,1:10:19.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是可爱
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.87,1:10:24.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好香喔
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.24,1:10:26.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我刚才泡了花香澡呢
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.88,1:10:27.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然泡好了澡
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.01,1:10:30.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家来吃晚饭吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.38,1:10:31.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赞成…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.45,1:10:38.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒喔
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.19,1:10:39.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家尽量的吃
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.59,1:10:41.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后好好的休息
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.62,1:10:44.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开动了…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.63,1:10:48.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好喝
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.40,1:10:50.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真希望可以\N一直住在这个地方
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.83,1:10:52.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们想住多久就住多久
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.90,1:10:54.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等你们恢复了体力
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.34,1:10:56.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再送你们去巴格达
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.14,1:10:59.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 等到了那个时候
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.64,1:11:02.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你们几位\N能吃下这个遗忘药
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.91,1:11:04.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要吃这个东西
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.91,1:11:08.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这么快乐的事情\N为什么要遗忘呢
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.92,1:11:11.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一旦黄金宫殿的事情\N传到外头去
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.92,1:11:16.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是魔神跟士兵种子\N落到那些贪婪之徒的手上
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.36,1:11:18.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就不得了了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.23,1:11:23.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是那个人口贩子阿布基鲁\N他已经知道这里的事情耶
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.07,1:11:24.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.93,1:11:28.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得已经\N给他吃过遗忘药了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.50,1:11:31.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会不会因为\N他对这里的印象很深刻
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.17,1:11:33.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以还留着一些\N片段的记忆啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.74,1:11:37.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个嘛也很有可能
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.42,1:11:46.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.59,1:11:49.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是怎么在这里\N建造这座宫殿的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.43,1:11:54.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有那些不可思议的收集品\N他又是怎么样得来的呢
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.43,1:11:58.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些问题到现在\N都还是一个谜耶
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.30,1:12:01.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说对不对 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.67,1:12:05.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的这么快就睡着了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.38,1:12:14.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 你快点起来
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.32,1:12:15.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点起来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.82,1:12:16.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.02,1:12:20.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听到了奇怪的声音耶
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.96,1:12:30.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干嘛啦 人家睡的正熟
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.40,1:12:36.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个声音听起来好可怕
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.41,1:12:38.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,声音是从那边传过来的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.72,1:12:47.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是国王吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.35,1:12:49.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在水池边做什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.85,1:12:52.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.42,1:12:54.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你们给吵醒了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.66,1:12:56.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王 你在做什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.43,1:12:59.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直很担心\N阿布基鲁那个坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.50,1:13:02.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以想用千里眼池\N来观察他一下
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.80,1:13:04.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千里眼池
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.67,1:13:08.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是可以看到\N很远的景色的池塘
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.44,1:13:10.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么东西都看不到啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.67,1:13:13.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道是不是故障了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.68,1:13:15.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要敲几下
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.81,1:13:18.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才能够看得到影像呢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.38,1:13:21.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我家的电视好像喔
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.95,1:13:27.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到影像了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.39,1:13:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是阿布基鲁
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.26,1:13:29.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿布基鲁
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.09,1:13:30.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在做什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.46,1:13:34.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他嘴里咬着一根绳子\N看着一块板子
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.33,1:13:38.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是水手在航行的时候\N测量方位的道具
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.40,1:13:39.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,方位
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.34,1:13:42.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,影像又乱掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.04,1:13:44.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会这样呢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.34,1:13:45.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再让我们看一下啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.54,1:13:46.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点让我们看一下
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.84,1:13:48.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点啦
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.55,1:13:53.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全看不到了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.78,1:13:56.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿布基鲁到底在测量\N哪个地方的方位啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.05,1:13:59.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是我这个黄金宫殿吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.92,1:14:03.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从那里走到这\N要10天以上的时间
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.99,1:14:05.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且还要经过一个
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.73,1:14:09.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相当炙热\N叫做地狱锅底的沙漠
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.30,1:14:10.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说的话
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.23,1:14:13.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类是无法做到吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.71,1:14:26.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这三只老鼠因为闻到了食物\N才会跑出来的是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.58,1:14:29.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快把水跟食物交出来
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.02,1:14:32.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不然老鼠会变成毒蝎喔
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.82,1:14:37.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿…这不是卡西姆的声音吗
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.73,1:14:40.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你啊 阿布基鲁
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.83,1:14:44.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来这里\N是找你说的黄金宫殿
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.77,1:14:46.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我都找不到
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.34,1:14:49.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的到底是真的还是假的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.41,1:14:50.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.61,1:14:54.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过你们是\N绝对不可能找到的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.41,1:14:55.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在还没有找到之前
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.78,1:14:59.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们可能就已经变成\N地狱锅底的木乃伊了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.85,1:15:01.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是你就到得了了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.68,1:15:03.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.12,1:15:04.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.49,1:15:08.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我知道黄金宫殿的秘密
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.56,1:15:11.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前我离开宫殿的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.29,1:15:14.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛巴达那个家伙\N让我吃下了遗忘药
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.80,1:15:15.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.07,1:15:21.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是装做吃下去的样子\N其实之后我都吐掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.57,1:15:23.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是你们愿意\N当我的手下的话
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.01,1:15:26.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以带你们去喔
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.21,1:15:27.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.44,1:15:28.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直太可恶了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.81,1:15:31.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然要我当你的手下
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.51,1:15:34.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不愿意的话我也不强求
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.78,1:15:35.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老大
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.89,1:15:39.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们才不想变成\N地狱锅底的木乃伊呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.52,1:15:42.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们先向他低头吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.29,1:15:45.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.46,1:15:48.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请收我们三个当你的手下
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.73,1:15:52.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样才算识相嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.48,1:16:09.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还真难走
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.25,1:16:11.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到处都是石头
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.12,1:16:12.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都快累毙了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.92,1:16:14.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少说废话
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.19,1:16:15.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不快跟着我走
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.69,1:16:17.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.00,1:16:27.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得是在这附近啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.37,1:16:28.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.14,1:16:30.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这块岩石没错
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.08,1:16:36.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这块岩石怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.65,1:16:38.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仔细看清楚啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.85,1:16:41.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芝麻开门
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.22,1:16:43.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快呀
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.23,1:16:53.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动作快一点 快
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.86,1:16:55.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.23,1:16:57.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走快点啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.17,1:17:03.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芝麻关门
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.91,1:17:11.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉好像到了\N另外一个世界一样耶
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.61,1:17:12.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的没错
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.82,1:17:16.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个通道就是通到\N另外一个世界去的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.05,1:17:18.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要吓我好不好
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.49,1:17:19.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有吓你
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.69,1:17:20.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,证据就是
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.99,1:17:22.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就已经走了\N10天的路程了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.13,1:17:23.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.89,1:17:25.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真是假
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.26,1:17:27.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们自己看一看就知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.13,1:17:30.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芝麻开门
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.21,1:17:45.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.21,1:17:47.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前面那就是黄金宫殿
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.72,1:17:50.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是黄金宫殿啊
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.46,1:18:01.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 真的好厉害喔
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.66,1:18:04.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,船在沙漠上行走耶
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.37,1:18:06.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这没什么好惊讶的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.44,1:18:08.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为这叫作沙船
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.54,1:18:12.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也是我的众多珍藏品之一
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.48,1:18:15.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是没想到
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.61,1:18:17.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,船还能够在沙漠上行走
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.68,1:18:20.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这根本没什么好大惊小怪的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.25,1:18:22.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这座宫殿里\N还有数不清的宝物
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.12,1:18:24.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们都已经出去了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.39,1:18:25.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啦 我们快走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.99,1:18:27.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.19,1:18:34.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这扇门根本就打不开啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.57,1:18:37.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这样乘风而行
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.00,1:18:39.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不禁让我想起年轻的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.07,1:18:41.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王年轻的时候…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.07,1:18:44.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我到世界各国造访许多国家
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.71,1:18:47.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总共出海航行了七次
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.64,1:18:48.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.34,1:18:49.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那鲸鱼好大喔
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.91,1:18:51.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是一般的鱼啦
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.48,1:18:52.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是海豚
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.35,1:18:57.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是沙豚
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.72,1:19:00.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是我的众多收藏品之一
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.86,1:19:10.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.31,1:19:22.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个叫做沙鲸
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.75,1:19:25.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那也是你的珍藏品之一吗
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.95,1:19:27.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.26,1:19:37.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这什么声音啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.69,1:19:38.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是预警胸针
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.06,1:19:40.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕 宫殿里出事了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.06,1:19:44.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想很有可能是那些坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.13,1:19:47.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些恶徒
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.21,1:19:55.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.21,1:19:57.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快进去里面把门打开
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.48,1:19:58.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.28,1:20:03.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.92,1:20:06.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡西姆 快点啊
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.72,1:20:09.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜得没错
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.73,1:20:11.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果真是阿布基鲁那帮人
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.73,1:20:14.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动作快点
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.11,1:20:24.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.81,1:20:26.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要先找到收藏品
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.44,1:20:29.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么一来\N这个宫殿就是我们的了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.61,1:20:31.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去 快
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.02,1:20:34.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底放在哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.52,1:20:36.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老大
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.69,1:20:38.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了没有
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.19,1:20:42.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下子世界上\N最有钱的就是我们了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.89,1:20:43.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.46,1:20:44.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先别管黄金了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.89,1:20:46.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要赶快找到那些收藏品
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.46,1:20:47.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那才重要啊
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.63,1:20:50.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能让那些收藏品\N落入歹徒的手中
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.83,1:20:52.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老大 这里
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.64,1:20:56.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们大家看啊
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.77,1:21:00.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往收藏品的房间去了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.42,1:21:10.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.35,1:21:10.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.99,1:21:13.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神灯被拿走了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.43,1:21:28.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的主人 您召唤我是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.67,1:21:30.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神灯啊神灯
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.74,1:21:33.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点出来
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.44,1:21:35.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您在叫我吗
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.24,1:21:39.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我命令你快点打倒他
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.45,1:21:41.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别开玩笑啦
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.18,1:21:44.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是个懦夫
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.82,1:21:48.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后用这个来收拾你们
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.32,1:21:50.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是士兵种子
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.46,1:21:51.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.09,1:21:54.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是为了报复\N你昨天对付我的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.90,1:21:57.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王跟这些人抓起来
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.47,1:22:05.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把我们抓起来\N到底想干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.04,1:22:09.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我等一下会想想\N要怎么处置你们
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.85,1:22:10.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之呢
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.61,1:22:12.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他们全都关到地牢里去
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.78,1:22:14.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.19,1:22:22.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个世界\N已经是属于我们的了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.73,1:22:24.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿布基鲁国王
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.79,1:22:27.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫我阿布基鲁国王陛下
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.63,1:22:30.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿布基鲁国王陛下
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.57,1:22:33.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为我们新的王国干杯吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.24,1:22:34.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干杯
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.66,1:22:59.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神灯
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.40,1:23:00.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快把我们放出去啦
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.60,1:23:03.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是国王的珍藏品吗
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.83,1:23:07.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有用的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.24,1:23:11.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些道具只会听从\N使用者的命令
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.54,1:23:14.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是哆啦A梦的\N百宝袋还在的话就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.48,1:23:15.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,百宝袋
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.68,1:23:16.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么东西啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.98,1:23:21.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以从袋子里面\N拿到各种未来世界的道具
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.48,1:23:23.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未来
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.69,1:23:27.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得那个男的也是说\N他是从未来来的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.86,1:23:30.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说从未来来的男生
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.29,1:23:31.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.26,1:23:33.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是在我第七次航行的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.93,1:23:37.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我出海去冒险\N并不是为了赚大钱
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.70,1:23:40.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想亲眼见识一下
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.44,1:23:45.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔神魔法还是妖怪\N这种未知的世界
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.57,1:23:50.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至要我付出我的财产\N或生命我都愿意
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.31,1:23:53.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在我最后一次的航海之旅
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.22,1:23:58.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在一场暴风雨当中\N我救了一名男子
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.59,1:24:01.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这名男子很特别
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.33,1:24:07.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当我跟他提起\N我小时候的梦想的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.40,1:24:10.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说为了要报答\N我的救命之恩
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.33,1:24:12.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要帮我实现梦想
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.40,1:24:15.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不知道他是从哪里\N弄来了这些宝物
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.34,1:24:19.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还帮我在这个沙漠的尽头\N建造了这座宫殿
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.34,1:24:22.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个人就是从\N未来世界来的时间旅行者
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.91,1:24:23.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说的话
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.75,1:24:27.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些宝物\N全都是未来的道具啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.25,1:24:29.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到这个梦想的国度
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.18,1:24:32.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然落入那些恶徒的手中
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.86,1:24:34.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好烫
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.76,1:24:35.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.99,1:24:38.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好烫
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.33,1:24:41.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这个火球
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.37,1:24:46.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.20,1:24:47.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在暴风雨的海上
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.57,1:24:50.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把我们救起来的就是他了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.94,1:24:51.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米库金
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.01,1:24:52.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉你们
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.57,1:24:54.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不是那么没有责任的人
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.88,1:24:56.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算被你们欺负回家去
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.58,1:24:58.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还是看着时光电视
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.38,1:25:00.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你们遇到困难的时候\N就来救你们
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.02,1:25:02.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是你啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.38,1:25:03.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.02,1:25:06.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是最棒的导游了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.39,1:25:08.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听起来他是我们这一国的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.02,1:25:09.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.79,1:25:10.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他叫做米库金
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.89,1:25:12.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是未来世界的导游
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.36,1:25:14.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本公司叫做时间旅行社
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.90,1:25:18.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会替旅客安排\N十分安全的旅游行程
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.53,1:25:19.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以参观一下
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.90,1:25:21.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先不要管这些了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.37,1:25:24.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是先逃出去再说吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.24,1:25:26.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请旅客不用担心
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.81,1:25:30.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁现在快走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.41,1:25:31.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒喔
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.62,1:25:41.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被他们逃走了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.06,1:25:44.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿布基鲁国王
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.06,1:25:47.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王 他们逃走了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.56,1:25:50.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王 他们逃走了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.70,1:25:52.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿布基鲁国王
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.84,1:25:59.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米库金
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.27,1:26:01.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的时光机的出口在哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.84,1:26:02.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.85,1:26:03.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.28,1:26:06.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把它停在宫殿的中庭
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.08,1:26:10.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是三流的导游
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.45,1:26:11.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么又这样说
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.65,1:26:13.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁叫你们急急忙忙冲出来
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.36,1:26:14.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你们自己不好
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.09,1:26:17.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说这是什么话啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.23,1:26:19.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 不要再吵了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.29,1:26:20.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.10,1:26:22.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中庭已经回不去了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.93,1:26:27.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之\N我们先离开这里再说吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.11,1:26:35.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芝麻开门
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.82,1:26:43.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家动作快一点
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.55,1:26:48.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在芝麻关门
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.83,1:27:00.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样找到没有啊
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.40,1:27:02.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太暗了 看不清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.20,1:27:03.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这倒不用急
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.71,1:27:06.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那几个小鬼\N根本就没什么本事
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.41,1:27:10.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到最后他们只会\N饿死渴死在沙漠里面
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.35,1:27:11.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等着瞧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.99,1:27:17.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们别管我
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.02,1:27:18.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是水手
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.02,1:27:21.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我在陆上走还真不习惯啊
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.42,1:27:22.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是这样下去
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.72,1:27:24.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们很快就会追上来的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.86,1:27:26.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像三岁小孩
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.50,1:27:28.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真拿这个老爷爷没辄
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.60,1:27:32.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水手辛巴达上了年纪\N真的就不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.10,1:27:33.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.00,1:27:34.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是因为
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.87,1:27:39.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟我所崇拜的辛巴达\N实在是差太多了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.04,1:27:42.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说你崇拜的…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.18,1:27:43.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不只是我
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.31,1:27:46.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界上凡是看过\N天方夜谭的小朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.25,1:27:48.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都很崇拜尊敬你呢
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.32,1:27:49.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点也没错
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.62,1:27:51.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管辛巴达在冒险中\N碰到什么危险
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.95,1:27:53.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管历经多少次危机
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.76,1:27:57.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他都会用他的智慧跟勇气\N去面对它
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.19,1:28:00.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还为自己开创了一条\N康庄大道呢
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.26,1:28:01.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们说的没错
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.90,1:28:03.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知不觉的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.77,1:28:06.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的心态也跟着渐渐老去了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.64,1:28:07.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.54,1:28:09.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去把宫殿给要回来
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.71,1:28:12.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样才是\N我们心目中的辛巴达
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.14,1:28:16.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不容易聚集了士气
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.55,1:28:18.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是百宝袋还在就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.65,1:28:21.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再提这件事了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.22,1:28:22.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的百宝袋
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.35,1:28:25.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是哆啦什梦\N胸前那个脏兮兮的袋子吗
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.72,1:28:27.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脏兮兮就不用强调了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.06,1:28:31.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个东西卡西姆他们\N把它丢在沙漠里了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.06,1:28:34.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把它捡回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.57,1:28:37.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.43,1:28:40.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.10,1:28:41.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么一来
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.44,1:28:42.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就什么都不怕了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.07,1:28:44.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米库金是一流的导游
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.87,1:28:45.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.31,1:28:48.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是没有我这个百宝袋
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.38,1:28:51.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就真的只是\N一只机器猫而已
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.08,1:28:55.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算有百宝袋\N你一样还是机器猫啊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.95,1:28:57.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们赶快回去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.32,1:28:59.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要让那些坏蛋知道\N我们的厉害才行
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.89,1:29:01.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.52,1:29:02.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然这样
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.32,1:29:04.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就先用飞天魔毯吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.03,1:29:08.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚好缺货
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.20,1:29:10.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就用飞天包巾吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.27,1:29:12.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好丑喔
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.60,1:29:14.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别再挑剔了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.92,1:29:29.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.72,1:29:31.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都解决掉了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.49,1:29:33.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,究竟是怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.86,1:29:36.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么东西啊
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.66,1:29:37.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿布基鲁
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.63,1:29:39.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快把我的宫殿还给我
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.49,1:29:42.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一群笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.50,1:29:44.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他们射下来
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.00,1:29:50.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们掉到中庭去了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.64,1:29:52.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个不留都给我抓起来
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.38,1:29:57.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快到宫殿里去
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.76,1:30:09.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.32,1:30:10.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.53,1:30:12.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.47,1:30:23.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快拿道具出来
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.84,1:30:26.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要拿哪个道具出来比较好呢
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.78,1:30:29.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,依照目前这种情况
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.28,1:30:31.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看最好先用穿越圈
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.06,1:30:44.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要把那些士兵们
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.36,1:30:46.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部都变成我们这一国的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.43,1:30:47.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样才行
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.93,1:30:49.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是能够拿到种子箱
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.63,1:30:50.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.80,1:30:52.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变身饮料
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.44,1:31:00.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样很像吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.08,1:31:06.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿布基鲁国王
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.38,1:31:10.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点\N把士兵种子的箱子拿给我
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.02,1:31:13.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 知道了主人
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.32,1:31:17.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吓死我了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.33,1:31:21.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些人跑到什么地方去了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.60,1:31:23.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.60,1:31:24.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你拿这个干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.77,1:31:27.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿布基鲁国王叫我拿来的耶
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.84,1:31:31.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对喔
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.91,1:31:34.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我自己下的命令嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.11,1:31:38.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主人 我拿来了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.48,1:31:40.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦你了\N给你
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.55,1:31:44.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,士兵们现在立刻变回种子
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.75,1:31:46.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 接下来…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.63,1:31:59.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.37,1:32:00.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.57,1:32:04.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照这么看来\N是有人冒充我的样子
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.37,1:32:05.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶的坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.01,1:32:08.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一次绝对饶不了你们
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.08,1:32:11.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,士兵们准备
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.15,1:32:13.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给他们点颜色瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.02,1:32:23.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蠢蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.46,1:32:26.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瓶中的魔神在我手上
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.33,1:32:32.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主人 是您在召唤我吗
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.33,1:32:32.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.03,1:32:34.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是瓶中的大魔神
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.34,1:32:36.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快把他们全部都杀掉
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.91,1:32:41.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.24,1:32:44.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔神 你觉悟吧
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.62,1:32:51.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.26,1:32:57.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快踩扁他
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.06,1:32:59.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.49,1:33:01.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大魔神
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.26,1:33:04.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,缩小灯
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.37,1:33:10.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大魔神缩小了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.57,1:33:15.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是那个臭狸猫害的
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.21,1:33:18.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老大 这样不行耶
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.58,1:33:20.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别怕 我还有一招
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.15,1:33:23.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王 你没事吧\N国王
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.39,1:33:24.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.52,1:33:25.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.39,1:33:27.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.36,1:33:27.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.09,1:33:29.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可爱的魔神
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.39,1:33:31.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.23,1:33:40.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.47,1:33:44.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他竟然连让宫殿\N飞起来的机关都知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.42,1:33:57.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宫殿绝对不能让他抢走
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.82,1:34:02.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险啊
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.06,1:34:11.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿布基鲁你这个恶徒\N给我觉悟吧
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.13,1:34:11.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡西姆
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.63,1:34:12.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还在干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.63,1:34:13.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来支援我
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.70,1:34:15.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.84,1:34:18.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少废话 我才懒得管你呢
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.94,1:34:23.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用竹蜻蜓根本就追不上
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.71,1:34:25.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先下去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.35,1:34:33.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再跑快一点
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.37,1:34:54.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛巴达
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.18,1:34:58.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凡是跟我作对的人\N就是这种下场
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.55,1:35:01.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太小看我了阿布基鲁
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.82,1:35:02.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.48,1:35:03.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可要搞清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.89,1:35:08.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是被汹涌的大海\N养大的水手辛巴达
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.19,1:35:09.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请您高抬贵手饶了我
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.99,1:35:11.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了…\N太棒了…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.96,1:35:13.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好耶…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.70,1:35:16.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好卑鄙喔
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.70,1:35:18.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是卑鄙小人
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.20,1:35:20.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卑鄙小人又怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.14,1:35:22.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.21,1:35:29.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不快点投降
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.28,1:35:36.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛喔
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.60,1:35:48.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.10,1:35:50.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.81,1:35:58.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总算是结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.94,1:36:00.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.44,1:36:02.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛巴达好耶\N好耶…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.52,1:36:12.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们大家
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.05,1:36:15.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很感谢你们伸出友谊的双手
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.39,1:36:18.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让黄金宫殿再度恢复和平
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.56,1:36:20.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.33,1:36:24.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一次我一定会确实\N让他们吃下遗忘药
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.97,1:36:27.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再送他们回去巴格达
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.77,1:36:32.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了你们几位一定要回去吗
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.47,1:36:33.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.21,1:36:36.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的家人会担心我们呢
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.14,1:36:38.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 你说的没错
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.48,1:36:40.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们很快会再来找你的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.98,1:36:44.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次顺便把辛巴达\N的画册带来好了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.72,1:36:45.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.49,1:36:47.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.29,1:36:48.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就这么说定了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.09,1:36:50.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.99,1:36:52.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到时候请再跟我们联络
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.09,1:36:55.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本公司非常乐意\N再为大家服务
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.00,1:36:56.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以啊
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.60,1:36:57.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过呢…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.67,1:36:59.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是导游能够再坦率一点
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.07,1:37:02.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说我不够坦率啰
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.50,1:37:03.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.61,1:37:05.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,

